{%- comment -%}
  Proper display names for the social networks. Liquid's `capitalize` gives
  "Linkedin" and "Youtube", which are wrong as brand names and get read aloud
  that way by a screen reader.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case network -%}
  {%- when 'facebook' -%}Facebook
  {%- when 'instagram' -%}Instagram
  {%- when 'pinterest' -%}Pinterest
  {%- when 'linkedin' -%}LinkedIn
  {%- when 'youtube' -%}YouTube
  {%- else -%}{{ network | capitalize }}
{%- endcase -%}
